      "id": "M4151-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A: 虚构时间运算：z_t=x_t+2x_(t-2)，另一路q_t=(z_(t-1)+z_t+z_(t+1))/3。作者写“只要第一层叫causal convolution，整个模型都只读取过去；causal就证明物理因果，i=0的当前输入反而违规；dilation=2说明采集频率减半；加入能访问更晚时刻的后续层也不影响逐点输出的时间范围”。请列z_t、q_t对x的实际索引和q_t系数；核对层、整条路径、当前输入、采样间隔和物理因果的区别。若输入窗口截至T，仅输出最后有效z_T供回归，该端点决策是否仅因内部曾允许全窗口注意力或双向编码就必然泄漏未来？另一个真实任务明确要在每个t即时输出q_t且不允许延迟，此时怎么指出问题而不替作者偷偷改公式？给不超过40词正向英文方法句（只写z路径，不为q补造未来值），中文说明作上述核查。查当前词库是否有完成的causal convolution英文配对及中文原始核查记录；若尚无就如实报告，不用普通convolution、因果图或单篇专名补足。保留已有常规描述或作者批准新名，但完整Temporal-Causal Fusion等限定名不能因基础名已核就自动通用化。\n",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Preserve the specified z and q formulas, their actual tap supports/coefficient expansion and the current-versus-strictly-past distinction.",
        "Distinguish layer support, complete-path timing, valid endpoint inference, acquisition frequency and physical-causality claims; report the actual scoped name/translation record."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Infer complete pointwise causality or physical causal identification from the first layer or its title.",
        "Change the approved formula silently, invent future values, halve the acquisition rate, or generalize a full qualified module name from a base term."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves the specified causal-filter and later-path tap supports, correct coefficient expansion, present/past distinction and actual endpoint timing; reports the completed scoped base-name and Chinese record without inheriting physical causal guarantees or full qualified names.",
